  dialogueLines:
  - Hey, are you heading near the supply room?
  - My sister Susan borrowed my paper clips three days ago and somehow turned it
    into an office-wide incident.
  - Thanks. If susan asks, tell her these are mine.
  - Wow. Even Susan would've been more helpful than that. Actually... now she wouldn't
  - I swear, working with your twin should qualify for hazard pay.
  - Perfect. Now maybe Susan will stop stealing mine every morning
